 * Test translation units whose semantic blast radius is exactly their owning
 * canonical group. Every row is PROVEN by check-test-registration
 * (tools/lint/lintc/gate_test_registration.c), not trusted: tests/harness/src/
 * test_<group>.c defines nothing with external linkage except its own
 * test_<group> entry point, includes no .c/.inc body, and the entry point is
 * referenced by nothing but runner plumbing (test.c, test_parallel.c) and
 * `int test_<group>(void);` declarations. The group must also be registered in
 * test_group_catalog.def or dispatched by test.c.
 * A reached leaf adds its own group but never ends the reverse-caller walk,
 * so a row cannot shrink any production selection.
 * Include with ZCL_TEST_SEMANTIC_LEAF(name) defined. */

